UPDATE companies SET description='HB Specialty Foods operates from its headquarters in Nampa, Idaho, with additional manufacturing facilities in Boise, Idaho; Beloit, Wisconsin; and Cookeville, Tennessee.

The company provides turnkey solutions for food manufacturers, spanning custom product development, R&D, procurement, co-packing, regulatory compliance, certification, blending, shipping, specialty crop sourcing, contract dry blending, and specialty packaging. Its three manufacturing facilities feature specialty segregated lines to prevent cross-contamination, and the firm manages relationships with over 20,000 acres of growers across the Pacific Northwest for conventional, organic, biodynamic, and regenerative crops.

HB serves food manufacturers and brands seeking to bring cleaner-label, natural, and sustainable products to market faster. Customers include businesses scaling from small-batch production to high-volume runs, as well as companies requiring allergen-controlled environments and regulatory guidance for shelf-ready packaging.

The company positions itself as a partner in the shift toward healthier, more sustainable food, emphasizing flexibility, deep ingredient expertise, and end-to-end supply chain management. Its differentiators include BRCGS-certified facilities, direct farmer connections, and a legacy in coating technology that informs its broader product development capabilities.', certifications=ARRAY['BRCGS']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom product development", "Research and development", "Ingredient procurement", "Co-packing", "Regulatory compliance", "Certification support", "Dry blending", "Shipping and logistics", "Specialty crop sourcing", "Contract dry blending", "Specialty packaging", "Supply chain management", "Customer fulfillment", "New product scale-up", "Coating systems (batters, breaders, coatings)", "Specialty segregated manufacturing"], "industries": ["Food manufacturing", "Food ingredients", "Clean label foods", "Organic foods", "Specialty crops"], "materials": ["Grains", "Crops", "Conventional ingredients", "Organic ingredients", "Biodynamic ingredients", "Regenerative-grown ingredients", "Allergen-controlled ingredients", "Coating systems (batters, breaders)", "Dry blends"], "equipment": ["Specialty packaging lines"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Specialty segregated facilities to prevent cross-contamination", "Direct relationships with over 20,000 acres of growers for specialty crops", "Three manufacturing facilities across the United States", "BRCGS food safety certification", "Deep expertise in coating systems (batters, breaders, coatings)"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Nampa, Idaho -> db", "Facilities in Boise, Idaho; Beloit, Wisconsin; Cookeville, Tennessee -> /, /about-us, /services, /capabilities", "Co-founder Beau Guthrie, Co-CEO -> /capabilities", "Founded on coating systems (batters, breaders, coatings) -> /capabilities", "Three manufacturing facilities across the country -> /capabilities", "Specialty se