UPDATE companies SET description='Their vision was to create a local supplier offering the same breadth of equipment as national chains but with a higher standard of personalized service.

The company provides a range of home medical equipment and services, including home oxygen therapy, breast pumps, sleep therapy (CPAP/BiPAP), home infusion therapy, enteral nutrition, wound care, and incontinence and urology supplies. A clinical team of pharmacists, registered nurses, assistive technology professionals (ATPs), and respiratory therapists coordinates with patients'' insurance carriers and healthcare providers to deliver equipment and supplies directly to the home. HME Specialists describes itself as New Mexico''s largest local medical equipment and supply company.

Its customers are primarily patients requiring respiratory support, infusion therapy, nutritional support, or wound management, as well as the healthcare providers and insurers who authorize that care. Testimonials reference long-term oxygen users, CPAP patients transitioning equipment, hospice patients needing urgent DME delivery, and families managing tracheostomy care at home.

The founders'' stated purpose was to offer a local alternative to national suppliers with more personalized service. The company''s mission is to help each patient reach their highest level of medical independence by delivering equipment and services seamlessly with exceptional care, and it emphasizes community involvement through partnerships with organizations such as the American Lung Association and the American Heart Association.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Home oxygen therapy", "Breast pump provision", "Sleep therapy (CPAP/BiPAP)", "Home infusion therapy", "Enteral nutrition support", "Wound care supplies", "Incontinence and urology supplies", "Insurance coordination and billing", "Clinical consultation (pharmacists, RNs, ATPs, respiratory therapists)", "Equipment delivery and setup", "Urgent/after-hours DME delivery"], "industries": ["Home medical equipment (DME)", "Respiratory care", "Sleep therapy", "Infusion therapy", "Enteral nutrition", "Wound care", "Incontinence care", "Urology supplies", "Hospice/palliative care support"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Oxygen concentrators", "Nebulizers", "Ventilator circuits", "CPAP machines", "BiPAP machines", "Trilogy ventilators"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Clinical team includes pharmacists, registered nurses, ATPs, and respiratory therapists", "Coordinates with insurance carriers and healthcare providers for direct-to-home delivery", "New Mexico''s largest local medical equipment and supply company", "Community partnerships with health-focused nonprofits (American Lung Association, American Heart Association)", "Urgent/after-hours DME delivery capability"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2001 by four New Mexicans -> /about", "Headquarters in Santa Fe, New Mexico -> db", "Services: home oxygen therapy, breast pumps, sleep therapy, home infusion therapy, enteral nutrition, wound care, incontinence & urology -> /", "Clinical team includes pharmaci