UPDATE companies SET description='Heights Woodworking was founded in 1946 by Amor Villar as the Heights Carpenter and Paint Shop in Brooklyn, New York. The business expanded across the five boroughs and is now led by Jonas Sigle, a contractor and designer with three decades of experience in New York construction and renovation.

