UPDATE companies SET description='Hogan Woodwork Inc. has operated from Countryside, Illinois since 1990. The family‑owned and ‑operated shop began as a woodwork business serving homeowners throughout the Chicagoland area with custom interior and exterior doors, trim, crown moulding, fireplace mantels, paneling, and radius woodwork.

