UPDATE companies SET description='Homewood Metalworks was founded in 1991 in Conway, South Carolina. The company operates its primary manufacturing shop and a 68,000‑square‑foot warehouse in Conway, with additional sales offices in Florence, Moncks Corner, and Laurinburg, North Carolina.

The firm manufactures custom metal and steel roof and wall panels, structural buildings, and related accessories. It provides a turnkey construction service that includes design of metal buildings to match client floor plans, utility installation, and general contracting. The Conway facility houses an experienced crew and a dedicated fleet of construction vehicles and heavy equipment.

Homewood Metalworks serves homeowners, contractors, and commercial builders across Horry, Florence, Georgetown, Brunswick, Scotland, Robeson, Berkeley, Dorchester, and Charleston counties.

