UPDATE companies SET description='IHI Connectors, the trade name of International Hydraulics Inc., operates its main office, assembly, and warehouse at 7700 St. Clair Avenue in Mentor, Ohio. The company produces high-tensile tin-plated aluminum electrical lugs and mechanical screw-type connectors for stranded and solid aluminum and copper wire.

Its product line includes single-, double-, triple-, and multi-wire lugs, splicer reducers, through-hole and surface-mount PCB terminal lugs rated from 20 to 300 amps, and custom OEM designs. The facility supports blanket orders with weekly, monthly, or quarterly releases and stocks standard parts in quantities from single pieces to full boxes. Representative PCB lugs include the B6B-PCB (65 A, 6–14 AWG), B4B-PCB-B (95 A, 4–14 AWG, all-copper body), and B2/0-PCB (175 A, 2/0–8 AWG). STEP files are available for all catalog items.

The company serves the smart-energy and renewable-energy sectors, supplying components for EV chargers, inverter battery-backup systems, server-farm power supplies, solar installations, industrial furnaces, and motion-control servo power supplies. Customers range from volume buyers ordering direct through the LugsDirect.com channel to OEMs requiring custom connectors quoted to print.

IHI Connectors emphasizes U.S. manufacturing and factory-direct pricing. Its patented Tork Krimp® lugs accept ferrules without pre-crimping, eliminating special tools and labor. The firm also offers the broadest range of high-current PCB terminal lugs on the market and holds UL and CSA approvals for fine-stranded wire classes G, H, I, DLO, K, MTW, welding, and battery cable up to 444 kcmil. A CAGE code (7RPR4) enables government contracting.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001','UL Listed','UL Recognized']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Tin-plated aluminum wire lug manufacturing", "Mechanical screw-type connector assembly", "Splicing connector production", "PCB terminal lug manufacturing (through-hole and surface-mount)", "Custom OEM connector design and production", "Blanket order and scheduled release programs", "STEP file provision for standard parts", "Dual multiple wire barrel capability (2\u00d7 #14 to 2\u00d7 #2 AWG class B/C)", "Interlocking connector stacking", "Fine-stranded wire lug production (classes G, H, I, DLO, K, MTW, welding, battery cable)"], "industries": ["Smart energy", "Renewable energy", "EV charging", "Inverter battery backup", "Server farm power supplies", "Solar power", "Industrial furnaces", "Motion control servo power supplies"], "materials": ["Tin-plated aluminum", "Aluminum", "Copper", "Brass"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["USA-made electrical lugs sold at factory-direct prices", "Patented Tork Krimp\u00ae technology allows ferrule use without pre-crimping or special tools", "World''s widest range of high-current PCB terminal lugs (20 A to 300 A)", "UL and CSA approved for fine-stranded wire classes G, H, I, DLO, K, MTW, welding, and battery cable", "CAGE code 7RPR4 for government procurement"], "facts_used": ["Location: Mentor, Ohio -> page ''/''", "Company name: International Hydraulics Inc. (AKA IHI Connectors) -> page ''/''", "Products: tin-plated aluminum lugs, mechanical screw